# Variant builds beside the shipped ones, for measuring one shader against another without
# editing the tree (`analysis_e/_team/ACC16闁插秵绁?md`). The .spv are covered by the *.spv rule
# below; the .comp copies are throwaway derivatives of src/gpu/*.comp and must not be taken
# for real sources 閳?a second `gemm_staged.comp` in the tree is exactly the confusion this
# project has been bitten by before.
/work_acc16/
